## Why This Is Asked
This question probes real-world design for geo-distributed, policy-driven AI helpers with strong data governance and canary controls.

## Key Concepts
- Regional OpenAI inference and API Management orchestration
- Per-tenant policy engine (PII, residency) in Cosmos
- Canary rollout governance and feature flags
- PII redaction with Text Analytics and privacy-by-design
- KB grounding with Cognitive Search; audit logging to Data Lake
- Secrets management with Key Vault; end‑to‑end telemetry with Monitor

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: select region, validate tenant policy, route to OpenAI, redact PII in response
function handleRequest(req){
  const tenant=req.headers['x-tenant'];
  if(!policyOk(tenant, req.body)) throw new Error('Policy violation');
  const region=regionForTenant(tenant);
  const resp=openAiCall(req.body, region);
  return redact(resp, tenant);
}
```

